<ContentPage slug="about-us" label="About Us">
          <h2>About Us</h2>
          <h3>What We Offer</h3>
          <p>Welcome to our Mario Strikers community!</p>
          <p>Here you can meet other fans, talk about everything related to the series, find regular matches, and join events and tournaments across all Mario Strikers games.</p>
          <p>We also run the Mario Strikers League, where players compete to climb the ranks and become one of the greatest Strikers of all time.</p>
          <p>Whether you're here to play casually, improve your skills, or compete at the highest level - you're welcome to join the fun!</p>
          <h3>Copyright &amp; Trademarks</h3>
          <p>Mario Strikers and related trademarks are the property of Nintendo. Mario Strikers Community is an independent, fan-run community and is not endorsed by or affiliated with Nintendo in any way.</p>
  </ContentPage>
